    {
      "id": "b000016",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 22,
      "end_line": 27,
      "raw": "- `NavigationApplicationViewBar.qml` now mirrors the Figma metadata order\n  `ViewOptionBar -> ModeBar -> CalendarBar -> AddNewBar -> PreferenceBar`.\n- View-only icon contracts that diverged from the shared navigation bars now live in local files under this\n  directory so edit/control mode wrappers stay isolated.\n- The view-option `Center View` action now uses LVRS `recursiveMethod`, while the mode-level `Center View Mode`\n  action keeps LVRS `singleRecordView`; those two Figma glyphs are intentionally different.\n",
      "items": [
        {
          "marker": "-",
